# AU DIC Benchmark Evaluation Framework — Implementation Plan (Sprints 001–005)

## Overview
This implementation plan outlines the engineering roadmap for constructing the **AU DIC Benchmark Evaluation Framework**. The evaluation framework will headlessly run datasets generated by **ADBG v1.0** through the AU DIC Document Intelligence engine (`UaipDocumentAiService`) and produce publication-ready accuracy metrics, degradation curves, and IEEE LaTeX tables.

**ADBG v1.0** is frozen as an immutable downstream dependency. No changes will be made to ADBG, template engines, degradation operators, or ground truth schemas.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Non-Destructive Execution Policy**:
> - **ADBG v1.0** is 100% frozen and unmodified.
> - AU DIC production pipelines (`UaipDocumentAiService`, `KnowledgeRecordModel`, `UaipUpload`) will remain unchanged during evaluation runs.
> - Benchmark runs will execute headlessly in memory or via dedicated benchmark modules without writing mock records to production database collections.

