## Proposed Changes & Module Architecture

We propose creating a dedicated, self-contained benchmark module under `backend/src/modules/benchmark/` (or `benchmark/`):

### [Component 1] Data Adapters & Domain Interfaces
#### [NEW] [AdbgGroundTruthAdapter.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/adapters/AdbgGroundTruthAdapter.ts)
- Loads ADBG ground truth JSON files (`groundtruth/{profile}/{category}/*.json`) and maps them into standard `BenchmarkGroundTruth` domain models.

#### [NEW] [AuDicPredictionAdapter.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/adapters/AuDicPredictionAdapter.ts)
- Passes ADBG PNG/JPEG/PDF specimens through AU DIC document intelligence pipeline (`UaipDocumentAiService`) and normalizes predictions into `BenchmarkPrediction` domain models.

---

### [Component 2] Comparators & Metric Engine
#### [NEW] [StringDistanceComparator.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/comparators/StringDistanceComparator.ts)
- Computes Character Error Rate (CER) and Word Error Rate (WER) using Levenshtein Edit Distance algorithm.

#### [NEW] [SubjectArrayComparator.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/comparators/SubjectArrayComparator.ts)
- Compares extracted mark sheet subject rows against ground truth subjects (code, name, credits, grade, gradePoints).

#### [NEW] [FieldLevelEvaluator.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/evaluators/FieldLevelEvaluator.ts)
- Computes per-field Precision, Recall, and F1 Score across document types (Certificate, Marksheet, Student ID).

---

### [Component 3] Quality Profile & Robustness Evaluators
#### [NEW] [ProfileRobustnessEvaluator.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/evaluators/ProfileRobustnessEvaluator.ts)
- Measures performance drop across `clean`, `scanner_copy`, `mobile_camera`, and `rotated_90` quality profiles.

---

### [Component 4] Runner & Publication Exporters
#### [NEW] [BenchmarkRunner.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/runner/BenchmarkRunner.ts)
- Batch execution orchestrator for running evaluations across 360 samples with configurable concurrency.

#### [NEW] [LatexTableGenerator.ts](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/backend/src/modules/benchmark/reports/LatexTableGenerator.ts)
- Auto-generates IEEE / Scopus compliant LaTeX tables for manuscript inclusion.

